T}	T{
Address containment in prefixes or single addresses;\: a value that is not an address is never contained
T}
T{
\fBx matches "pattern"\fR,\: \fBmatches(x,\: "pattern")\fR
T}	T{
RE2 match anywhere in the value;\: anchor with \fB^\fR and \fB$\fR for the whole value. Patterns are literals,\: compiled at load
T}
