the identity a preceding auth filter verified this request against,\: preferring \fBoidc\fR,\: \fBjwt\fR,\: \fBapi_\:key\fR then \fBbasic\fR;\: unlike \fBjwt:\:<claim>\fR it cannot be spoofed,\: because the filter proved it. Evaluated after the filter chain,\: so the limiter sees the authenticated principal
T}	T{
client address (unauthenticated)
T}
