T}	T{
Default
T}	T{
Description
T}
T{
\fBheader\fR
T}	T{
name
T}	T{
\fBX\-\:Xproxy\-\:Signature\fR
T}	T{

T}
T{
\fBsecret_\:file\fR
T}	T{
path
T}	T{
required
T}	T{
Keyring shared with the origin (mode \fB0600\fR,\: created on first start;\: \fBxproxyctl rotate\-\:secret\fR adds a new primary and keeps the previous key,\: so the origin verifies with either while it is updated)
T}
T{
\fBttl\fR
T}	T{
duration
T}	T{
\fB5m\fR
T}	T{
Age the origin should accept;\: a signature is also refused more than a minute in the future
T}
T{
\fBinclude\fR
T}	T{
list of headers
T}	T{
\fB[]\fR
T}	T{
