.SH "jwt"
.PP
Present means providers are available; routes opt in with a \fBjwt\fR block. Tokens are validated on the standard library: RSA (PKCS#1 v1.5 and PSS), ECDSA, Ed25519 and HMAC signatures, JSON Web Key Sets from a file or an HTTPS URL, and the standard time and audience claims. \fBnone\fR is never accepted.
.SS "jwt.providers[]"
.PP
.TS
