.PP
Required when any listener has \fBtls.acme\fR groups. One account per proxy; the account key, account URL and issued certificates live under \fBstate_dir\fR (mode \fB0700\fR, files \fB0600\fR), so a restart serves the existing certificates immediately and only renews what is due.
.PP
.TS
