.SH "challenge"
.PP
Present means the challenge engine is available; routes opt in with a \fBchallenge\fR block. Unverified clients receive a 503 page with a signed nonce and a script that finds a SHA\-256 proof of work, posts it to \fB/.xproxy/challenge\fR, and receives a signed cookie. Both reserved paths (\fB/.xproxy/challenge\fR and \fB/.xproxy/challenge.js\fR) are served on every host before routing.
.PP
