Sample this percentage of the exchanges the rule would otherwise take (1 to 100). Sampling is per exchange,\: and a sampled\-out exchange is counted as skipped
T}
T{
\fBmax_\:flows\fR
T}	T{
int
T}	T{
\fB0\fR
T}	T{
Stop after writing this many exchanges for this rule,\: so a rule left on cannot fill a disk. \fB0\fR is unbounded,\: at most 10000000;\: the count resets on reload
T}
.TE
.PP
Selectors within a rule are AND, values within a selector are OR, and rules are tried in order. To capture one route for one client, put both selectors in one rule; to capture two unrelated things, write two rules.
